text = "Dynamic Difficulty (PvE-only, bounded ±20%, reward-neutral).

This game adjusts enemy stats slightly based on your recent performance in PvE stages only. The system is:

 • PvE-only — PvP matches are never affected.
 • Bounded — enemy health, damage, and spawn rate can only change by ±20% from their baseline values.
 • Reward-neutral — XP, gold, and loot drops are never modified by this system. A harder run does not pay better.

You can opt out from Settings → Dynamic Difficulty at any time."
fit_content = true
scroll_following = true

